  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0938f329-9b29-42b0-89b1-2846e8ca3af7-image.png\" style=\"width: 371px; height: 214px;\" /></p><p>A tangent to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></math> can be written as:<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> &hellip;. (1)<br />It will touch the hyperbola <math><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> if the quadratic <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>4</mn></math> has coincident roots,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Equating of common tangent will be <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
